  "notes" : [
    {
      "note" : "# Genuary 4\n\n> Lowres. An image or graphic with low resolution, where details are simplified or pixelated.\n\nThis patch Requires Fabric Alpha 7 or better (stay tuned)\n\nThis patch features\n\n\n* A movie player\n   * Dont forget to load your own content in!\n\n* 2 independent Pixelization -> Crosshatch chains\n* The top path has a a transparent background\n* We composite them over one another\n* We then apply some post processing to get a nice look\n\nThats it!\n\n### Experiment\n\nPlay around with the cross hatch controls, its admittedly a bit finicky and needs to be tuned \n\nPlay around with different pixelization amounts for each pass\n\nTry adding a new pixelization pass and another color \/ cross hatch (hint, you’ll need another composite over too)",
      "rect" : [
        [
          -709.3826690059268,
          -222.01391933887498
        ],
        [
          500,
          500
        ]
      ],
      "id" : "D925D5E5-BAEF-469B-BFAF-7F74AFC539BB"
    }
  ],
